      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_34",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("The party once again took up Rakshas’s trail. They soon received a report from a scouting gryphon that in an enormous fortress a few leagues west from them, Rakshas was assembling a massive orcish force, clearly intending to crush their revolt once and for all."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_35",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("The gryphon further reported that a few more leagues west was a large force of dwarvish veterans, advancing steadily on the orcish fortress."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_36",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("Battle plans were quickly made; the party split into three groups. Two of the groups immediately set off northwest and southwest respectively while the third group rested for an hour and then set off west."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "story_37",
        on: "start",
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            text: _("The idea was to completely surround Rakshas, cutting off any chance of escape or reinforcements."),
          },
        ],
      },
